. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H3 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * Random effects panel GLS regression with standard errors clustered 
> on the pair level. 
.         * We regress the dependent variable on an indicator for having at lea
> st one daughter.
. 
.         xtset pid syear

Panel variable: pid (unbalanced)
 Time variable: syear, 2001 to 2020, but with gaps
         Delta: 1 unit

.         xtreg h3_dep_var has_daughters, vce(cluster pid) 

Random-effects GLS regression                   Number of obs     =    111,306
Group variable: pid                             Number of groups  =     15,555

R-squared:                                      Obs per group:
     Within  = 0.0072                                         min =          1
