  h3_dep_var | Coefficient  std. err.      z    P>|z|     [95% conf. interval]
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
has_daught~s |  -.6623901   .0651888   -10.16   0.000    -.7901578   -.5346225
       _cons |   2.687912   .0463239    58.02   0.000     2.597118    2.778705
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
     sigma_u |  3.2485686
     sigma_e |  2.6107384
